      "notes": "FR-037 hook failure: `postCreateCommand` exits 23, and the run must fail rather than report success for a container whose setup did not complete. The failing configuration is supplied as an override so the preceding `up` can succeed — a hook failure during creation is a different case, and conflating them would leave neither pinned. The two sides DISAGREE here, which 024 US4 established by running both: the reference skips a lifecycle command the container has already completed and exits 0 without executing the hook, so the failure is invisible on its side. Tolerated under `wvr-ruc-completed-hooks-not-rerun` and pinned in direction by `case-errorpath-ruc-post-create-failure-direction`."
